/*⁣‌⁠⁠​⁠⁠⁠‌‍‍​​​⁠‍⁠‌‌​‍‍‍‌‌​‌⁠‍⁠⁠‍‌​⁠⁠‍⁠‌‍‌‍⁠​⁠⁠⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‍​​‌‍⁠‌⁠‍​​‌‍⁣ ============================================
   仿 QQ 主题
   ============================================ */

/* ---------- 全局变量与内置覆盖 ---------- */
:root {
  --chat-bg-color: #EDEDED;
  --chat-bg-image: none;
  --chat-bg-blur: 0px;
  --chat-bg-overlay: transparent;
  --chat-header-bg: #EDEDED;
  --chat-header-blur: 0px;
  --chat-header-border: none;
  --chat-header-title-color: #747474;
  --chat-header-title-size: 17px;
  --chat-header-title-weight: 600;
  --chat-header-subtitle-color: #8C8C8C;
  --chat-header-subtitle-size: 12px;
  --header-btn-gap: 4px;
  --input-area-bg: #EDEDED;
  --input-area-blur: 0px;
  --input-area-border-top: none;
  --reply-bar-accent: #CDCDCD !important;
  --reply-bar-text-color: #CDCDCD !important;
  --wa-bubble-me: transparent !important;
  --wa-bubble-them: transparent !important;
  --plain-gap-between-groups: 10px !important;
  --plain-gap-within-group: 5px !important;
  --chat-messages-gap: 5px !important;

  /* 名片卡片 */
  --contact-card-bg: #FFFFFF !important;
  --contact-card-radius: 12px !important;
  --contact-card-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) !important;
  --contact-card-text: #747474 !important;
  --contact-card-sub: #8C8C8C !important;
  --contact-card-avatar-radius: 50% !important;
  --contact-card-foot: #8C8C8C !important;

  /* 表情与潜台词 */
  --reaction-badge-bg: transparent !important;
  --reaction-badge-border: none !important;
  --reaction-badge-shadow: none !important;
  --reaction-badge-padding: 0 !important;
  --reaction-badge-size: 14px !important;
  --subtext-toggle-bg: transparent !important;
  --subtext-eye-color: transparent !important;
  --subtext-note-bg: #FFFFFF !important;
  --subtext-note-color: #8C8C8C !important;

  /* 语音控件 */
  --voice-length-scale: 0.8 !important;
  --voice-len-base: 8px !important;
  --voice-len-range: 16px !important;
  --voice-controls-gap: 2px !important;
  --voice-container-gap: 4px !important;
  --voice-waveform-gap: 1px !important;
  --voice-waveform-height: 18px !important;
  --voice-bar-min-width: 1.5px !important;
  --voice-bar-max-width: 1.5px !important;
  --voice-bar-radius: 1px !important;
  --voice-play-btn-size: 16px !important;
  --voice-me-color: #a6a3a3 !important;
  --voice-me-bar-active: #a6a3a3 !important;
  --voice-me-bar-inactive: rgba(166, 163, 163, 0.35) !important;
  --voice-them-color: #a6a3a3 !important;
  --voice-them-bar-active: #a6a3a3 !important;
  --voice-them-bar-inactive: rgba(166, 163, 163, 0.35) !important;
  --voice-duration-size: 11px !important;
  --voice-duration-weight: 500 !important;
}

