/*⁣‌⁠⁠​⁠⁠⁠‌‍‍​​​⁠‍⁠‌‌​‍‍‍‌‌​‌⁠‍⁠⁠‍‌​⁠⁠‍⁠‌‍‌‍⁠​⁠⁠⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‍​​‌‍⁠‌⁠‍​​‌‍⁣ 水長流(蓝)by Xu.0 🈲禁二传二改*/
:root {
  --b-me: #2b2828;   --t-me: #fff;
  --b-them: #2b2828; --t-them: #fff;
  --av: 34px;
}

.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom {
  position: relative !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  padding: 9px 16px !important;
  border-radius: 22px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border: none !important;
  min-width: 64px;
}
.bubble-me-custom   { background: var(--b-me) !important;   color: var(--t-me) !important;   --tail: var(--b-me); }
.bubble-them-custom { background: var(--b-them) !important; color: var(--t-them) !important; --tail: var(--b-them); }

:is(.is-last, .is-single) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom)::before,
:is(.is-last, .is-single) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom)::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; background: var(--tail); pointer-events: none;
}
:is(.is-last, .is-single) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom)::after {
  width: 30px; height: 10px; top: calc(100% - 3px);
  border-radius: 0 0 50% 50% / 0 0 100% 100%;
}
:is(.is-last, .is-single) :is(.bubble-me-custom, .bubble-them-custom)::before {
  width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; top: calc(100% + 6px);
}
:is(.is-last, .is-single) .bubble-me-custom::after    { right: 15px; }
:is(.is-last, .is-single) .bubble-me-custom::before   { right: 44px; }
:is(.is-last, .is-single) .bubble-them-custom::after  { left: 15px; }
:is(.is-wrapper.-last, .is-single) .bubble-them-custom::before { left: 44px; }

.msg-bubblemsg-me,
.msg-bubble-wrapper.msg-them { flex-direction: column !important; }
.msg-bubble-wrapper.msg-me   { align-items: flex-end !important; }
.msg-bubble-wrapper.msg-them { align-items: flex-start !important; }
.msg-me .msg-content-stack   { align-items: flex-end !important; }
.msg-them .msg-content-stack { align-items: flex-start !important; }
.msg-content-stack { order: 1 !important; }

.msg-avatar-me-container,
.msg-avatar-them-container {
  order: 2 !important;
  display: none !important;
  margin: 18px 0 0 0 !important;
}
.msg-avatar-me-container:is(.is-last, .is-single),
.msg-avatar-them-container:is(.is-last, .is-single) {
  display: block !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  width: var(--av) !important;
  height: var(--av) !important;
}
.msg-avatar-me-inner, .msg-avatar-them-inner {
  width: var(--av) !important;
  height: var(--av) !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
}

.msg-bubble-wrapper.is-last, .msg-bubble-wrapper.is-single { margin-bottom: 20px !important; }
.msg-bubble-wrapper.is-first, .msg-bubble-wrapper.is-mid  { margin-bottom: 4px !important; }

.bubble-me-custom.no-padding,
.bubble-them-custom.no-padding,
.bubble-me-custom.msg-radius-media,
.bubble-them-custom.msg-radius-media {
  background: transparent !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  border-image: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
  backdrop-filter: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  transform: none !important;
}
.bubble-me-custom.no-padding::before, .bubble-me-custom.no-padding::after,
.bubble-them-custom.no-padding::before, .bubble-them-custom.no-padding::after,
.bubble-me-custom.msg-radius-media::before, .bubble-me-custom.msg-radius-media::after,
.bubble-them-custom.msg-radius-media::before, .bubble-them-custom.msg-radius-media::after {
  display: none !important;
}

.chat-detail-screen .bubble-me-custom img,
.chat-detail-screen .bubble-them-custom img {
  max-width: 120px !important;
  max-height: 150px !important;
  width: auto !important;
  height: auto !important;
  object-fit: contain !important;
  border-radius: 12px !important;
}

.chat-detail-screen .bubble-me-custom img[class*="sticker"],
.chat-detail-screen .bubble-them-custom img[class*="sticker"],
.chat-detail-screen .bubble-me-custom img[class*="emoji"],
.chat-detail-screen .bubble-them-custom img[class*="emoji"] {
  max-width: 100px !important;
  max-height: 100px !important;
  width: auto !important;
  height: auto !important;
  object-fit: contain !important;
  border-radius: 12px !important;
}

.chat-detail-screen .msg-reply-block-detached img {
  max-width: none !important;
  max-height: none !important;
  width: auto !important;
  height: 30px !important;
  object-fit: contain !important;
  border-radius: 4px !important;
}

:root { --av-shift: 31px; }

.msg-avatar-me-container,
.msg-avatar-them-container {
  order: 2 !important;
  display: none !important;
  margin-top: 18px !important;
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
}
.msg-avatar-me-container:is(.is-last, .is-single),
.msg-avatar-them-container:is(.is-last, .is-single) {
  display: block !important;
  visibility: visible !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  width: var(--av) !important;
  height: var(--av) !important;
}
.msg-avatar-me-container   { margin-right: var(--av-shift) !important; margin-left: 0 !important; }
.msg-avatar-them-container { margin-left: var(--av-shift) !important; margin-right: 0 !important; }
.msg-reply-block { display: none !important; }

.msg-reply-block-detached {
  --lx: 48px;
  --rq-gap: 10px;
  display: flex !important;
  position: relative !important;
  align-items: center !important;
  gap: 8px !important;
  width: max-content !important;
  max-width: 78vw !important;
  margin: var(--rq-gap) 0 0 0 !important;
  padding: 6px 0 6px calc(var(--lx) + 28px) !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
}
.msg-bubble-wrapper:is(.is-first, .is-mid) .msg-reply-block-detached { --lx: 28px; }

.msg-reply-block-detached::before {
  content: "" !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  left: var(--lx);
  top: calc(-1 * var(--rq-gap));
  width: 22px;
  height: calc(50% + var(--rq-gap));
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--b-them);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--b-them);
  border-bottom-left-radius: 12px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.msg-reply-detached-name { font-size: 0 !important; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.msg-reply-detached-name::after { content: none !important; display: none !important; }
.msg-reply-detached-name::before {
  content: "回復" !important;
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--b-them);
  color: var(--t-them);
}

.msg-reply-detached-text,
.msg-reply-detached-media {
  flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0;
  color: #9a9a9a !important;
  font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 600 !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important; overflow: hidden !important; text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
}

.msg-reply-block-detached::after {
  content: "" !important;
  flex: 0 0 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: #ddd;
  background-size: cover; background-position: center;
}
.msg-reply-detached-them { align-self: flex-start !important; }
.msg-reply-detached-them::after { background-image: var(--user-avatar); }
.msg-reply-detached-me {
  align-self: flex-end !important;
  flex-direction: row-reverse !important;
  padding: 6px calc(var(--lx) + 28px) 6px 0 !important;
}
.msg-reply-detached-me::after { background-image: var(--char-avatar); }
.msg-reply-detached-me::before {
  left: auto; right: var(--lx);
  border-left: none; border-right: 2px solid var(--b-me);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--b-me);
  border-bottom-left-radius: 0; border-bottom-right-radius: 12px;
}
.msg-reply-detached-me .msg-reply-detached-name::before { background: var(--b-me); color: var(--t-me); }
.voice-msg {
  background: transparent !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;
  border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; position: relative !important;
}
.bubble-me-custom:has(.voice-msg), .bubble-them-custom:has(.voice-msg),
.msg-bubble-container:has(.voice-msg), .msg-content-stack:has(.voice-msg) {
  background: transparent !important; border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important;
  padding: 0 !important; border-radius: 0 !important;
}

.voice-msg .voice-controls-row {
  display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important;
  height: auto !important; min-height: 0 !important; max-height: none !important;
  width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;
  padding: 9px 16px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;
  background: var(--b-them) !important; color: var(--t-them) !important;
  border: none !important; border-radius: 22px !important; box-shadow: none !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 4 !important; pointer-events: none !important;
}
.msg-me .voice-msg .voice-controls-row {
  background: var(--b-me) !important; color: var(--t-me) !important;
}

.voice-msg .voice-play-btn {
  background: transparent !important; border: none !important; padding: 0 !important;
  width: 22px !important; height: 22px !important; flex-shrink: 0 !important;
  display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important;
  color: inherit !important; cursor: pointer !important; pointer-events: auto !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 5 !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-download-btn {
  background: transparent !important; border: none !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;
  flex-shrink: 0 !important; opacity: .7 !important;
  display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important;
  color: inherit !important; cursor: pointer !important; pointer-events: auto !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 5 !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-play-btn svg, .voice-msg .voice-download-btn svg {
  width: 18px !important; height: 18px !important;
  fill: currentColor !important; color: inherit !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-download-btn svg { width: 14px !important; height: 14px !important; }

.voice-msg .voice-waveform {
  display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 2px !important;
  height: 24px !important; flex: 1 !important; min-width: 40px !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 2 !important; pointer-events: none !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-waveform-bar {
  width: 3px !important; border-radius: 2px !important; flex-shrink: 0 !important;
  background: currentColor !important; opacity: .35 !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-waveform-bar.active { opacity: 1 !important; }

.voice-msg .voice-duration {
  font-size: 11px !important; font-weight: 400 !important; color: inherit !important; opacity: .75 !important;
  flex-shrink: 0 !important; min-width: 28px !important; text-align: right !important;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 2 !important; pointer-events: none !important;
}

.voice-msg .voice-transcription-toggle {
  display: block !important; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important;
  background: transparent !important; border: none !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;
  position: absolute !important; top: 0 !important; left: 0 !important; z-index: 3 !important;
  font-size: 0 !important; color: transparent !important; overflow: hidden !important;
  cursor: pointer !important; pointer-events: auto !important;
}
.voice-msg .voice-transcription-toggle * { display: none !important; }
.voice-msg .voice-transcription-toggle::before,
.voice-msg .voice-transcription-toggle::after { content: none !important; display: none !important; }

.voice-msg .voice-transcription {
  display: block !important; margin-top: 6px !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  padding: 9px 16px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; max-width: 100% !important;
  font-size: 13px !important; line-height: 1.4 !important;
  background: var(--b-them) !important; color: var(--t-them) !important;
  border: none !important; border-radius: 22px !important; box-shadow: none !important;
  word-break: break-word !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;
  position: relative !important; z-index: 1 !important; cursor: pointer !important;
}
.msg-me .voice-msg .voice-transcription { background: var(--b-me) !important; color: var(--t-me) !important; }
.voice-msg .voice-transcription.hidden { display: none !important; }

.msg-them .voice-msg { align-self: flex-start !important; }
.msg-me .voice-msg   { align-self: flex-end !important; }
:root {
  --st-gap: 10px;
}

.msg-avatar-me-inner,
.msg-avatar-them-inner {
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  border: 3px solid #fff !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px 1px rgba(120, 120, 120, 0.55) !important;
}

:root {
  --pill-fs: 7px;
  --st-gap: 8px;

  --st-x: 0px;
  --st-y: 50px;

  --on-x: 0px;
  --on-y: 10px;
}

.msg-status-custom,
.msg-status-custom.is-read,
.msg-status-custom.is-sent {
  position: relative !important;
  bottom: auto !important; right: auto !important; top: auto !important; left: auto !important;
  align-self: flex-end !important;
  width: fit-content !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0.3em 0.9em 0.3em 1.5em !important;
  font-size: var(--pill-fs) !important;
  line-height: 1.4 !important;
