/* --- 正在输入：主标题换成「对方正在输入中…」，副标题不变 --- */

/* 隐藏原角色名（font-size:0 让它不占宽度） */
div.chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-title,
div.chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-title > * {
  font-size: 0 !important;
}

/* 用 ::before 补上新标题，样式和原主标题一致 */
div.chat-detail-screen:has(.nuo-typing-indicator) .chat-header-title::before {
