/* ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ 【18 翻译 · 字幕条（参考屿）】 ◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆ */
/* 字幕条 z-index 10 > 气泡 z-index 1（02 段），低于顶栏 50
   只要每条消息的容器自己不成层（第 6 条），字幕条就盖得住上下所有气泡 */

/* 1. 藏掉气泡内的原翻译块 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-wrapper {
  display: none !important;
}

/* 2. 气泡外的独立翻译块：压进气泡底边 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached {
  display: block !important;
  position: relative !important;
  z-index: 10 !important;             /* 高于气泡(1)，低于顶栏(50) */
  width: max-content !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  max-width: 264px !important;        /* ← 一行最宽多少，超过才换行；11px 字号每 +11px 约多 1 个字 */
  margin-top: -10px !important;       /* ← 压进气泡的深度，越大盖得越多 */
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;        /* 往下盖的量在第 5 条 */
  padding: 0 0 3px !important;        /* 底部 3px 给字幕条的行内 padding 留位置 */
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
  line-height: 1.65 !important;       /* 一行约 18px */
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached::before,
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached::after {
  content: none !important;
  display: none !important;
}

/* 对方靠左 / 我方靠右 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-them {
  align-self: flex-start !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-me {
  align-self: flex-end !important;
  margin-right: 18px !important;
  margin-left: 0 !important;
}

/* 3. 一行不动；两行起整条上提 8px，压住原文最后一行一点
   100% = 字幕条自身高度：一行约 21px → 25px - 21px 为正，取 0；两行约 39px → 为负，封顶 -8px
   改上提量：两处 -8px 一起改 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-them {
  transform: translateX(10px) !important;
  transform: translate(10px, clamp(-8px, calc(25px - 100%), 0px)) !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-me {
  transform: none !important;
  transform: translate(0px, clamp(-8px, calc(25px - 100%), 0px)) !important;
}

/* 4. 字幕条本体：上下 padding 撑满行高，多行之间不留缝 */
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-content {
  display: inline !important;
  -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone !important;
  box-decoration-break: clone !important;
  background: #FFFFFF !important;
  color: #111111 !important;
  font-size: 11px !important;
  font-weight: 500 !important;
  line-height: 1.65 !important;
  padding: 3px 5px !important;        /* ← 上下 3px 刚好把行缝填上 */
  margin: 0 !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 2px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  white-space: normal !important;
  word-break: break-word !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
}
div.chat-detail-screen:not(#_k) .msg-translation-detached-content * {
