/*⁣‌⁠⁠​⁠⁠⁠‌‍‍​​​⁠‍⁠‌‌​‍‍‍‌‌​‌⁠‍⁠⁠‍‌​⁠⁠‍⁠‌‍‌‍⁠​⁠⁠⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‍​​‌‍⁠‌⁠‍​​‌‍⁣ 糯叽叽世界书美化 Nuojiji Worldbook CSS By thursday @qwronboqvv1sq4i */

/* fonts and layout */
:root {
  --font: "Inter Var", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "PingFang SC", "HarmonyOS Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-display: "Inter Var", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "PingFang SC", "HarmonyOS Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --wb-top: 46px;
  --wb-book-w: 100%;
  --wb-book-h: 104px;
  --wb-book-tilt: 0deg;
  --wb-book-lean-gap: 0px;
  --book-color: var(--book-1);
  --book-face: var(--face-1);
  --book-fallback: #44444e;
}

/* book colors */
:root {
  --book-1: linear-gradient(180deg, #44444e, #535357);
  --book-2: linear-gradient(180deg, #715a5a, #817171);
  --book-3: linear-gradient(180deg, #37353e, #424145);
  --book-4: linear-gradient(180deg, #393e46, #51555b);
  --book-5: linear-gradient(180deg, #3c3d37, #52534e);
  --book-6: linear-gradient(180deg, #697565, #767975);
  --book-7: linear-gradient(180deg, #503c3c, #5f4e4e);
  --book-8: linear-gradient(180deg, #7e7474, #a89a9a);
}

/* day theme */
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --bg: #f2f2f7;
  --glass: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  --glass-solid: #fff;
  --glass-edge: rgba(60,60,67,.13);
  --sheet: #f2f2f7;
  --card: #fff;
  --fill: rgba(118,118,128,.12);
  --fill-strong: rgba(118,118,128,.22);
  --label: #1c1c1e;
  --label-2: rgba(60,60,67,.68);
  --label-3: rgba(60,60,67,.35);
  --sep: rgba(60,60,67,.2);
  --blue: #007aff;
  --blue-soft: rgba(0,122,255,.12);
  --red: #ff3b30;
  --on-blue: #fff;
  --wb-cover-bg: var(--sheet);
  --wb-ink-soft: rgba(60,60,67,.8);
  --wb-ink-muted: rgba(60,60,67,.6);
  --wb-ink-faint: rgba(60,60,67,.35);
  --wb-menu-surface: var(--card);
  --wb-menu-text: var(--label);
  --wb-menu-border: var(--sep);
  --wb-book-accent: #636366;
  --wb-custom-panel-text: #636366;
  --wb-search-input: #8e8e93;
  --scroll-thumb: rgba(60,60,67,.3);
  --shadow-panel: 0 -12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  --shadow-floating: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  --shadow-control: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  --shadow-menu: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
  --shadow-tab: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
  --shadow-switch: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
  --overlay: rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  --badge-bg: #fff;
  --badge-text: #1c1c1e;
  --badge-ring: #f2f2f7;
  --tab-active: #fff;
  --switch-knob: #fff;
  --home-bar: #1c1c1e;
  --book-stroke: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  --book-glow: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  --secondary-hint: #8e8e93;
}

/* css panel */

.wb-cssp-sheet {
  background: var(--sheet) !important;
  color: var(--label) !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 22px 22px 0 0 !important;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-panel) !important;
  font-family: var(--font);
}

.wb-cssp-head {
  background: transparent !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-bottom: .5px solid var(--sep) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  padding: 14px 16px !important;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.wb-cssp-title {
  color: var(--label) !important;
  font: 600 17px/1.2 var(--font) !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
}

.wb-cssp-sheet button,
.wb-cssp-btn {
  background: var(--fill) !important;
  background-image: none !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 999px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  color: var(--blue) !important;
  font-family: var(--font) !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  text-transform: none !important;
  letter-spacing: 0 !important;
}

.wb-cssp-head button:last-child,
.wb-cssp-btn.primary,
.wb-cssp-btn.save,
.wb-cssp-btn.on {
  background: var(--blue) !important;
  color: var(--on-blue) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-btn.danger {
  color: var(--red) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-hint,
.wb-cssp-muted,
.wb-cssp-note,
.wb-cssp-ref-desc {
  color: var(--label-2) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-label,
.wb-cssp-group-title {
  color: var(--label-2) !important;
  font: 600 12px/1.3 var(--font) !important;
  letter-spacing: 0 !important;
  text-transform: none !important;
}

.wb-cssp-box {
  background: var(--card) !important;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: 12px !important;
}

.wb-cssp-row,
.wb-cssp-ref-item {
  border-bottom-color: var(--sep) !important;
  color: var(--label) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-row-name {
  color: var(--label) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-ref-code {
  color: var(--blue) !important;
}

.wb-cssp-warn {
  color: var(--label) !important;
}

/* scrollbars and toolbar */

* {
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: var(--scroll-thumb) transparent;
}

